{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ultimate Janitor Simulator</strong> \u2014 a relaxing first-person cleaning game where every messy room hides a story and every wipe brings back shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on different cleaning jobs, unlock the right tools, and restore order one task at a time. Every place you visit has its own kind of chaos \u2014 and your tools are the key to bringing it all back to perfect order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf4\u00a0<strong>General Dirt Scrubbing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your brush and tackle the toughest stains on walls and floors. Each stroke removes visible dirt in real time \u2014 see every surface go from filthy to spotless under your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/e3a9c6d677d0152c9e0feceb5d0ca349.poster.avif?t=1760987091\" width=708 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/e3a9c6d677d0152c9e0feceb5d0ca349.webm?t=1760987091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf9Tidying &amp; Object Placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all mess is about dirt. Pick up scattered items, return them to their places, and restore order to cluttered environments. Every object you fix brings you closer to full completion \u2014 and that perfect 100% clean rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/dba185f1f062708439b6802693e8f642.poster.avif?t=1760987091\" width=708 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/dba185f1f062708439b6802693e8f642.webm?t=1760987091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude9f Window Cleaning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back the sparkle! Use your squeegee and cleaning solution to wipe away watermarks, fingerprints, and grime from glass surfaces. Watch the reflections sharpen as you work and enjoy the oddly satisfying shine of a job well done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/0a0db1303ff793b664d3ab54cd40ecdb.poster.avif?t=1760987091\" width=708 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/0a0db1303ff793b664d3ab54cd40ecdb.webm?t=1760987091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccb </strong>Taskboard &amp; Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your goals with the in-game Taskboard. Each objective \u2014 from cleaning windows to tidying items \u2014 updates in real time as you work. Watch every task check off one by one until the entire job is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/8b75042cd308fa7fa97ac80bdd90fe60.poster.avif?t=1760987091\" width=708 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050800/extras/8b75042cd308fa7fa97ac80bdd90fe60.webm?t=1760987091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050800?t=1760987091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamsta